    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>ADD THE FULL GAME TO YOUR WISHLIST</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048210/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.poster.avif?t=1737477985\" width=605 height=49 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048210/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.webm?t=1737477985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Imagine inheriting a farm AND a shop. What would you do with it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, it's a mess. Yes, it needs work. But it's yours\u2014and it\u2019s free. In this economy?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048210/extras/d9f0b22354adc34adf141165888a069e.poster.avif?t=1737477985\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048210/extras/d9f0b22354adc34adf141165888a069e.webm?t=1737477985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048210/extras/d9f0b22354adc34adf141165888a069e.mp4?t=1737477985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Restore Your Farm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform this abandoned land into the thriving farm it deserves to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your own crops, take care of animals (coming soon), and upgrade your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It'll take effort, but soon you'll be able to acquire new tools, improve your buildings, and customize the farm of your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048210/extras/4f4d59bf9771c7bf1cd37fdc2cc03b3d.poster.avif?t=1737477985\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048210/extras/4f4d59bf9771c7bf1cd37fdc2cc03b3d.webm?t=1737477985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048210/extras/4f4d59bf9771c7bf1cd37fdc2cc03b3d.mp4?t=1737477985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open Your Own Shop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why sell your crops and produce to someone else when you can do it yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever heard of a farmer's market? Well, this shop has the &quot;farmer&quot; part sorted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize your shop, manage the goods on your shelves, and handle all the finances!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell directly to customers, or hire some help\u2014you\u2019re only human, after all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048210/extras/29b15700f47a2bdfd5e0ff3c7071eb6e.poster.avif?t=1737477985\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048210/extras/29b15700f47a2bdfd5e0ff3c7071eb6e.webm?t=1737477985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048210/extras/29b15700f47a2bdfd5e0ff3c7071eb6e.mp4?t=1737477985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the Art of Multitasking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running a farm and a shop at the same time isn\u2019t easy. But you\u2019ve got this!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance your time between tending to crops, serving customers, and managing the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do it all yourself, or hire help and order goods that you don't produce (at least, not yet).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you focus on strict business? Go personal and sustainable? Maybe a bit of both? Only you can decide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048210/extras/fc08a9e9534768ae1e640f75c7692d2e.poster.avif?t=1737477985\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048210/extras/fc08a9e9534768ae1e640f75c7692d2e.webm?t=1737477985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048210/extras/fc08a9e9534768ae1e640f75c7692d2e.mp4?t=1737477985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048210/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.poster.avif?t=1737477985\" width=605 height=49 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048210/extras/a02db74b02273195225b0fdca5b3be2f.webm?t=1737477985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Imagine inheriting a farm AND a shop. What would you do with it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, it's a mess. Yes, it needs work. But it's yours\u2014and it\u2019s free. In this economy?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048210/extras/d9f0b22354adc34adf141165888a069e.poster.avif?t=1737477985\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048210/extras/d9f0b22354adc34adf141165888a069e.webm?t=1737477985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048210/extras/d9f0b22354adc34adf141165888a069e.mp4?t=1737477985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Restore Your Farm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform this abandoned land into the thriving farm it deserves to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your own crops, take care of animals (coming soon), and upgrade your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It'll take effort, but soon you'll be able to acquire new tools, improve your buildings, and customize the farm of your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048210/extras/4f4d59bf9771c7bf1cd37fdc2cc03b3d.poster.avif?t=1737477985\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048210/extras/4f4d59bf9771c7bf1cd37fdc2cc03b3d.webm?t=1737477985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048210/extras/4f4d59bf9771c7bf1cd37fdc2cc03b3d.mp4?t=1737477985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open Your Own Shop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why sell your crops and produce to someone else when you can do it yourself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever heard of a farmer's market? Well, this shop has the &quot;farmer&quot; part sorted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize your shop, manage the goods on your shelves, and handle all the finances!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell directly to customers, or hire some help\u2014you\u2019re only human, after all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048210/extras/29b15700f47a2bdfd5e0ff3c7071eb6e.poster.avif?t=1737477985\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048210/extras/29b15700f47a2bdfd5e0ff3c7071eb6e.webm?t=1737477985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048210/extras/29b15700f47a2bdfd5e0ff3c7071eb6e.mp4?t=1737477985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the Art of Multitasking</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running a farm and a shop at the same time isn\u2019t easy. But you\u2019ve got this!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance your time between tending to crops, serving customers, and managing the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do it all yourself, or hire help and order goods that you don't produce (at least, not yet).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you focus on strict business? Go personal and sustainable? Maybe a bit of both? Only you can decide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048210/extras/fc08a9e9534768ae1e640f75c7692d2e.poster.avif?t=1737477985\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048210/extras/fc08a9e9534768ae1e640f75c7692d2e.webm?t=1737477985\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3048210/extras/fc08a9e9534768ae1e640f75c7692d2e.mp4?t=1737477985\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
